# 基础词 Unit29
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit29核心词汇

{{label}}{/ˈleɪbl/}}n. 标签；v. 贴标签}}{{Read the label carefully before taking the medicine.}}
{{labor}}{/ˈleɪbər/}}n. 劳动；劳动力}}{{The company relies on cheap labor to reduce costs.}}
{{lack}}{/læk/}}n./v. 缺乏；不足}}{{The project failed due to a lack of funding.}}
{{ladder}}{/ˈlædər/}}n. 梯子；阶梯}}{{He climbed the ladder to fix the roof.}}
{{lady}}{/ˈleɪdi/}}n. 女士；夫人}}{{The old lady sat on the park bench feeding the birds.}}
{{lake}}{/leɪk/}}n. 湖；湖泊}}{{They went swimming in the lake on a hot summer day.}}
{{land}}{/lænd/}}n. 土地；陆地；v. 着陆}}{{The plane landed safely at the airport.}}
{{landscape}}{/ˈlændskeɪp/}}n. 风景；景色}}{{The landscape in this region is breathtakingly beautiful.}}
{{language}}{/ˈlæŋɡwɪdʒ/}}n. 语言}}{{English is one of the most widely spoken languages in the world.}}
{{lap}}{/læp/}}n. 膝部；一圈}}{{The cat sat on her lap while she read a book.}}
{{large}}{/lɑːrdʒ/}}adj. 大的；大量的}}{{The company has a large number of employees worldwide.}}
{{laser}}{/ˈleɪzər/}}n. 激光}}{{Laser technology is used in many medical procedures.}}
{{last}}{/lɑːst/}}adj. 最后的；v. 持续}}{{The meeting lasted for three hours.}}
{{late}}{/leɪt/}}adj. 迟的；晚的；adv. 迟地}}{{She was late for the appointment due to heavy traffic.}}
{{later}}{/ˈleɪtər/}}adv. 后来；adj. 以后的}}{{I will call you later this evening.}}
{{laugh}}{/lɑːf/}}v. 笑；n. 笑声}}{{The audience laughed at the comedian's jokes.}}
{{launch}}{/lɔːntʃ/}}v. 发射；发起；n. 发射}}{{The company launched a new product last month.}}
{{law}}{/lɔː/}}n. 法律；法则}}{{Everyone is equal before the law.}}
{{lawyer}}{/ˈlɔːjər/}}n. 律师；法学家}}{{The lawyer represented his client in court.}}
{{lay}}{/leɪ/}}v. 放置；下蛋；铺设}}{{She laid the book on the table and left the room.}}
{{layer}}{/ˈleɪər/}}n. 层；层次}}{{The cake has three layers of chocolate and cream.}}
{{lead}}{/liːd/}}v. 领导；导致；n. 领导；铅}}{{Hard work and dedication lead to success.}}
{{leader}}{/ˈliːdər/}}n. 领导者；领袖}}{{A good leader inspires others to do their best.}}
{{leadership}}{/ˈliːdərʃɪp/}}n. 领导力；领导地位}}{{She demonstrated strong leadership during the crisis.}}
{{lean}}{/liːn/}}v. 倾斜；依靠；adj. 瘦的}}{{He leaned against the wall to rest.}}
{{learn}}{/lɜːrn/}}v. 学习；得知}}{{It is never too late to learn something new.}}
{{least}}{/liːst/}}adj. 最少的；adv. 最少}}{{She is the least experienced member of the team.}}
{{leave}}{/liːv/}}v. 离开；留下；n. 假期}}{{He left the office early to attend a family dinner.}}
{{lecture}}{/ˈlektʃər/}}n. 演讲；讲课；v. 讲课}}{{The professor gave a fascinating lecture on quantum physics.}}
{{legal}}{/ˈliːɡl/}}adj. 合法的；法律的}}{{The company's actions are perfectly legal.}}
{{lemon}}{/ˈlemən/}}n. 柠檬；adj. 柠檬色的}}{{She added a slice of lemon to her tea.}}
{{lend}}{/lend/}}v. 借出；贷款}}{{Could you lend me your dictionary for a few minutes?}}
{{length}}{/leŋθ/}}n. 长度；时间的长短}}{{The length of the bridge is about 500 meters.}}
{{lesson}}{/ˈlesn/}}n. 功课；教训}}{{The accident taught him a valuable lesson about safety.}}
{{let}}{/let/}}v. 让；允许}}{{Let me know if you need any help.}}
{{letter}}{/ˈletər/}}n. 信；字母}}{{She wrote a letter to her friend overseas.}}
{{level}}{/ˈlevl/}}n. 水平；标准；adj. 平的}}{{The level of competition in this league is very high.}}
{{liberal}}{/ˈlɪbərəl/}}adj. 自由主义的；开明的}}{{She holds liberal views on social issues.}}
{{liberate}}{/ˈlɪbəreɪt/}}v. 解放；释放}}{{The country was liberated from foreign rule in 1945.}}
{{library}}{/ˈlaɪbrəri/}}n. 图书馆}}{{The university library is open until midnight during exams.}}
